		{"id":"8f0ab5184f84d894","x":-680,"y":-2225,"width":1147,"height":705,"type":"text","text":"The universe is fundamentally made of Universal Fiber. It is what makes up the 3 Strands of the Universe: Warp, Weft, and Wyrd\n\nOwnership of a Wyrd Aspect in some Weave K:\n\nlet warpKnot(uulk: UULK): Set of Wyrd Knots tied to the given Universally Unique Loop Knot made with the Warp\nlet weftKnot(uulk: UULK, weave): Set of Wyrd Knots tied to the given Universally Unique Loop Knot made with the Weft on the given Weave\n\nlet wyrdKnots = intersection(warpKnot(uulk-i), weftKnot(uulk-i, weave-k))\nreturn wyrdKnots.map((knot) => knot.aspect).toSet()\n\n\nAxioms\n- A Being cannot tie knots of any kind on their own weave as they are made OF their own weave.\n- A Being may tie knots of any kind around themselves\n- A specific knot can only be tied once with a Warp Strand in the Universe\n- A specific knot can be tied multiple times with a Weft Strand in the Universe\n- A specific knot can be tied multiple times with a Wyrd Cord in the Universe\n- Warp & Weft strands can be used to created a 1 to many pairings when they match knot types\n\nTethering to a Wyrd Knot: Allows control of a Wyrd Aspect \"at a distance\"\n\n1. Create a universally unique loop knot (UULK) with a Warp strand around a being: often called a Warp Belt\n2. Create the same universally unique loop knot with a Weft strand around an Intersection in the target Weave\n\t1. This is often referred to as a \"Weft Anchor\"\n3. Finally, tie a knot that matches the target Wyrd Knot on the target Weave on both the Weft Knot and the Warp Knot\n\t1. First this causes a Weave pairing, the Wyrd Knot exists on the Weave itself, but now also on a Weft UULK that is also attached to the Weave. So the Wyrd Knot for that Weave is paired to that \"identity\"\n\t2. Secondly, the same wyrd knot being made on the Warp UULK around a being allows that being to use that knot to control the Weave Aspect corresponding with that Wyrd Knot in some Weave \"at a distance\" (if and only if there is a Weft UULK matching that Warp UULK AND it has the same Wyrd knot tied around it)\n\t"},
		{"id":"40003c56c09b6fec","type":"text","text":"Wyrd Wyrd Knot","x":3025,"y":-2020,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4735c401a5f4f88f","type":"text","text":"Weft Wyrd Knot","x":3305,"y":-2020,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b5193594b43a02a9","type":"text","text":"Warp Wyrd Knot","x":3585,"y":-2020,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7610aa04cd9a8a43","type":"text","text":"Temporal Wyrd Knot","x":3865,"y":-2020,"width":250,"height":60}
	],
